PayType:
NULL
          
CANADA PP 
CANADA STD
COD       
CREDIT CRD
FOREIGN PP
FOREIGNCOD
FOREIGNSTD
HOLD 4 PAY
LINKPOINT 
PAYPAL    
PREPAID   
STD TERMS 
WIRE TRANS
*/

RETURN (@cStdTermsStr)
END



